- Flex: Malefic Roar over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when the enemy front line stacks Physical Defense and your team can already protect your first position.; Wind of Nature over Rose Gold Meteor when Use against physical assassins or marksmen who can reach you before Flicker creates enough distance.; Sea Halberd over Rose Gold Meteor when Use when healing, shields, or high-extra-HP fighters keep the first target alive through your crit window.
